[{"sha":"42aeec1ecd407d45805585567ce0b9d0c8a0f8d7","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDQyYWVlYzFlY2Q0MDdkNDU4MDU1ODU1NjdjZTBiOWQwYzhhMGY4ZDc","commit":{"author":{"name":"John Kennedy","email":"65985482+jkennedyvz@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-01T01:37:43Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-01T01:37:43Z"},"message":"hotfix(talon): allow prerelease release dependencies (#4395)\n\nThe Talon release pre-check installs the built wheel from a clean venv.\nTalon depends on `deepagents-code`, and the currently published\n`deepagents-code` line pins the alpha SDK `deepagents==0.7.0a2`, so uv\nmust allow prerelease dependency resolution for Talon's release install\nchecks.\n\nThis updates Talon to require the latest `deepagents-code` package and\nscopes `--prerelease allow` to `deepagents-talon` in the release\nworkflow. Other packages continue to install built wheels with the\ndefault stable dependency resolution.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Deep Agent <agent@deepagents.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","tree":{"sha":"c1e586d15d515c98d0c9526402c9a408c7a7e781","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/c1e586d15d515c98d0c9526402c9a408c7a7e781"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/42aeec1ecd407d45805585567ce0b9d0c8a0f8d7","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRG9nCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhvEQAF0FHVcBb6cLGF6/stuziiYH\nJiRpe8kDjne2sTVd+t0FYzRwsCwNy0iU3IZWqLvrjimVX3U9Edz7YIdq8ipwXM9j\n4MFHbvViEH7Yj29lAxNTM+Ed8004zby5p42X9n4woqnoXGqV63+Lz2FhdWetoTiv\nIRShgiAPQgUKHkZUGwanIEbQ7yKCLagtDpKUkS1v7W688L4WEMv5oiUQLe/amF75\ntKdSRycbG30dRp9x0Vssd6VDUrIP/4XNY4a5xmEYIyax26irnwp+byOBgn79YWYM\nW2jjkoJin4F545vSjuvccYuA4uw4VU0E2tywK1/D15uUhfoJ7+GuPmULmgpHE0SJ\nWNnmYoOKXLobw8r4dKCIOwMG3Hw5EC43PXQD9sCrMBGACt0zoYlnqChD8mmLj7mR\nOMHf6uCgNE+qZ1HNmU/nIcGmk3YZSEQaQNc8E5kBKSLMHf3cehtyvfdGVJ29bp5f\nNOf+06TOLOSZisA9goFsskrqtb/IPecr/I/ls1BzdJtLFRtw6X/IBtSu/bAFnhQq\n74EtPItjuSckIGc1No33pcsYOSveQytPdaPfMLOV8gTYObCqcSUIo6xGR+NLmwQn\nqbDfgcCWdX1I8ux6T3pR+4YHHfnlV3mSJCtI68ch7usl0qdsW6Hf0XMC9Kp+zvHw\nwEoeMNrtQ6IMK4xcaYaa\n=nzP5\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree c1e586d15d515c98d0c9526402c9a408c7a7e781\nparent a2b7d8d14b18903daa0a64271db059a0f494254c\nauthor John Kennedy <65985482+jkennedyvz@users.noreply.github.com> 1782869863 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782869863 -0400\n\nhotfix(talon): allow prerelease release dependencies (#4395)\n\nThe Talon release pre-check installs the built wheel from a clean venv.\nTalon depends on `deepagents-code`, and the currently published\n`deepagents-code` line pins the alpha SDK `deepagents==0.7.0a2`, so uv\nmust allow prerelease dependency resolution for Talon's release install\nchecks.\n\nThis updates Talon to require the latest `deepagents-code` package and\nscopes `--prerelease allow` to `deepagents-talon` in the release\nworkflow. Other packages continue to install built wheels with the\ndefault stable dependency resolution.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Deep Agent <agent@deepagents.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>\nCo-authored-by: Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev>","verified_at":"2026-07-01T01:37:43Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/42aeec1ecd407d45805585567ce0b9d0c8a0f8d7","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/42aeec1ecd407d45805585567ce0b9d0c8a0f8d7","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/42aeec1ecd407d45805585567ce0b9d0c8a0f8d7/comments","author":{"login":"jkennedyvz","id":65985482,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1OTg1NDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65985482?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkennedyvz","html_url":"https://github.com/jkennedyvz","followers_url":"ht