_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"671c4f261767ce0b8f324b89a2e9b8a72ddaf1c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/671c4f261767ce0b8f324b89a2e9b8a72ddaf1c4","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/671c4f261767ce0b8f324b89a2e9b8a72ddaf1c4"}]},{"sha":"671c4f261767ce0b8f324b89a2e9b8a72ddaf1c4","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDY3MWM0ZjI2MTc2N2NlMGI4ZjMyNGI4OWEyZTliOGE3MmRkYWYxYzQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-30T19:58:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-30T19:58:26Z"},"message":"test(code): cover remote auto-approve HITL (#4392)\n\nAdds integration coverage for default TUI auto-approve behavior over the\nremote server path.\n\nThe new tests start the real local server with a deterministic\ntool-calling model, run through `execute_task_textual`, and verify\nauto-approve suppresses HITL prompts for both a top-level gated\n`write_file` call and the same gated call when delegated through the\ngeneral-purpose subagent. This locks in the healthy baseline while\ninvestigating narrower workflow-specific interrupt behavior.","tree":{"sha":"947dd17243e9d753e433acc36a015302aedd4516","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/947dd17243e9d753e433acc36a015302aedd4516"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/671c4f261767ce0b8f324b89a2e9b8a72ddaf1c4","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRB/iCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkTcQAHXn4HB3K9G6ENjlBLyHShJo\n/TpcFKNDY1ytyinu/4PCgmziLuT/EFfJsOSwbGejSFGmdn3FtFFayYfVUpt5TqJM\nwDF9W91vdid9bYjJzr18qaKP32PRi1AtutDscxGrBRt/wM0UFr2kuT9n/z/Du3c+\n8ZVgn6P+tIEsPKzrjQuYaKXVIAQtqtfVZioPV6FiSC4/ITUxyvzSlMPDaKRfHa4U\njvYVlpU35ogtC+wdo3PrO1z6BlaIQlfIGU7n5parTA5keF63EgwaQWCd7Fj7BZHo\n/AGzP4l8Rk0Jw4h6H3EXlW75n/ecoAtjBM1fxjtSwIppxlm6/KofiW8vvAyEpwt7\nBzM7L75Fs2Wc7OZfDvO389eb1ZnvbehUZA4ctn0lEcxBQX3UlBtIQF2CnZbIBRGG\nNGSEZAX9J50ZSKOpwrkitGLBBhh8gW5E19f4vwTIknC8Gq2gXswGOCpy25MQ7UZG\nzW0Ejq6GRmHMplEqnoAWDK4D6s0eRLXEXx+YPHCoUflkINz6cdmNRRGmRvRgwjIo\nu1CjgStxs3UZfnBBqvC7cAB78+6jOkP6/sIB4uhan8j7bOEJAzVeT6zJCzCKN4c/\nZeSqIfMlkbX7Uff7H8gxJUU6VuXaM/HwEYbVzNhuAToy05cUp7v2Pqapt4qHGZEM\nCiZJPj3ZfY9LyDj6F6BA\n=wUY9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 947dd17243e9d753e433acc36a015302aedd4516\nparent d740eac13faff19254ffd3d8e1da8eeaf2e26014\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1782849506 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782849506 -0400\n\ntest(code): cover remote auto-approve HITL (#4392)\n\nAdds integration coverage for default TUI auto-approve behavior over the\nremote server path.\n\nThe new tests start the real local server with a deterministic\ntool-calling model, run through `execute_task_textual`, and verify\nauto-approve suppresses HITL prompts for both a top-level gated\n`write_file` call and the same gated call when delegated through the\ngeneral-purpose subagent. This locks in the healthy baseline while\ninvestigating narrower workflow-specific interrupt behavior.","verified_at":"2026-06-30T19:58:27Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/671c4f261767ce0b8f324b89a2e9b8a72ddaf1c4","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/671c4f261767ce0b8f324b89a2e9b8a72ddaf1c4","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/671c4f261767ce0b8f324b89a2e9b8a72ddaf1c4/comments","author"