gs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"4b44925df9738c8bf828dfc7b0028aaedba28f9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/4b44925df9738c8bf828dfc7b0028aaedba28f9e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/4b44925df9738c8bf828dfc7b0028aaedba28f9e"}]},{"sha":"4b44925df9738c8bf828dfc7b0028aaedba28f9e","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDRiNDQ5MjVkZjk3MzhjOGJmODI4ZGZjN2IwMDI4YWFlZGJhMjhmOWU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-26T17:27:00Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-26T17:27:00Z"},"message":"style(code): mark default tracing project in `dcode doctor` (#4317)\n\n`dcode doctor` now marks the tracing project as `(default)` when it is\nthe built-in fallback rather than an explicit setting.\n\n---\n\n`dcode doctor` reports `project: deepagents-code` whether or not the\nuser set it. This adds a `(default)` marker next to the tracing project\nwhen it falls back to the built-in `deepagents-code` default because no\nproject was explicitly configured. An explicitly set project (even one\nnamed `deepagents-code`) shows no marker.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/bfb609d9-b37d-aaca-4151-d01e60c1f80b)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"cd92b563e926c9897ff36033c794e87e2aa07c4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/cd92b563e926c9897ff36033c794e87e2aa07c4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/4b44925df9738c8bf828dfc7b0028aaedba28f9e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nw