l":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-06-25T20:28:51Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-25T20:28:51Z"},"message":"chore(deps): bump the minor-and-patch group with 2 updates (#4284)\n\nBumps the minor-and-patch group with 2 updates:\n[CodSpeedHQ/action](https://github.com/codspeedhq/action) and\n[actions/setup-python](https://github.com/actions/setup-python).\n\nUpdates `CodSpeedHQ/action` from 4.17.5 to 4.18.1\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/codspeedhq/action/releases\">CodSpeedHQ/action's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v4.18.1</h2>\n<h2>Release Notes</h2>\n<h3><!-- raw HTML omitted -->🚀 Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Bump go-runner to 1.2.1 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/adriencaccia\"><code>@​adriencaccia</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/CodSpeedHQ/runner/pull/421\">#421</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Install codspeed-runner 4.18.1</h2>\n<h3>Install prebuilt binaries via shell script</h3>\n<pre lang=\"sh\"><code>curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf\nhttps://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed/releases/download/v4.18.1/codspeed-runner-installer.sh\n| sh\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Download codspeed-runner 4.18.1</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>File</th>\n<th>Platform</th>\n<th>Checksum</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed/releases/download/v4.18.1/codspeed-runner-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz\">codspeed-runner-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz</a></td>\n<td>Apple Silicon macOS</td>\n<td><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed/releases/download/v4.18.1/codspeed-runner-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz.sha256\">checksum</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/CodSpeedHQ/codspeed/releases/download/v4.18.1/codspeed-runner-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz\">codspeed-runner-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz</a></td>\n<td>ARM64 MUSL Linux</td>\n<td><a\nhref=\"ht