 tracked uv projects.\n\nThis updates the uv directory list so it covers every tracked project\nthat has both `pyproject.toml` and `uv.lock`, including the newly\naudited example and Talon projects.","tree":{"sha":"d7ff8230c1532019149f9e67c4b51267b1d45afb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/d7ff8230c1532019149f9e67c4b51267b1d45afb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/eea62aa667b9e4b5e4b2ffb6dcdf7b9b92e67e6d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPYskCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEhgQAKWX0GCrRSoO1zjeao91USUI\ngl2szV8DC0VpsF1UnfDBj2BQHiAVUI1SmnhE3nlZIxU0tEBSnNH1BhRBgA2m7CkE\n1a4F5rx0wqmFC2JS6x5WTo8JQnyZMpCQKorZEg9RrSFtCB8J3UQAVncCujj+Q2U6\n7YsIgvT52hxK+ekXYf6Sd8m70B5IlhohI4P1N9WYMy9zxZYMeo5K4QaNH6jH7wl0\nfJvJbDDRj19dSOcHUPhdU5BLRcbLHos3srUK35FAXvXIwQ4gCgCRSjI2dEo5R1Dh\nIgUHyegle42DYPCBnsPM7sFBZk1eCreSmczJL7kXnIrKHkUfWVNhDw0LfAV+V2x7\nImsQJyVwDMuLwHQcjjUFcLeqWw5+zSM0wOXD2nZBoL2eeuDUAQrB4Nn3/rLfQuqv\nsF7QlDrawkHXMItQNtdIsy6pS2q+Le9a/0zE1H5LSIBDnBJ11j0Rkea3fFuhhBzw\nPh2BWF758pNk//XGNzxGZAQolidq9BHnzBZh68/5oSoxfa5ckniOdX3pIHOS6ru4\n3JJrWfAWddJc6NSCTEmWQBcCQf8Dz5cQdMd+DKBPe3fnQ86yAYjN0r3oDH5XzOcG\n4eb+9I6qMMEQO7WZfSRWH/kI+d/E8tSLPGUeGSYm0BSiENz+fADgpPkGpP7Tuqee\nvsYkE+aqNJYKyhF2NCAK\n=NAn1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree d7ff8230c1532019149f9e67c4b51267b1d45afb\nparent d1e5d425f979f37e498183fe19ba643b6201c280\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1782418212 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782418212 -0400\n\nchore(infra): update Dependabot uv directories (#4283)\n\nDependabot opened a uv lockfile update for example projects that were\nnot included in the uv `directories` allowlist. That made the\nlockfile-fix workflow fail closed before minting write credentials, even\nthough the changed files belonged to tracked uv projects.\n\nThis updates the uv directory list so it covers every tracked 