,"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"3e550ac0a33aadf886da2e2df0eadc743263b9b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3e550ac0a33aadf886da2e2df0eadc743263b9b4","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3e550ac0a33aadf886da2e2df0eadc743263b9b4"}]},{"sha":"3e550ac0a33aadf886da2e2df0eadc743263b9b4","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDNlNTUwYWMwYTMzYWFkZjg4NmRhMmUyZGYwZWFkYzc0MzI2M2I5YjQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Nick Hollon","email":"nick.hollon@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-25T19:47:46Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-25T19:47:46Z"},"message":"ci(evals): scope clbench model secrets to the run step only (#4281)\n\n## Problem\n\nThe clbench workflow ran the whole benchmark in a **single** `run` step\nwhose `env:` injected every provider API key, with `LANGSMITH_API_KEY`\nset at the **job level**. That one step:\n\n1. `git clone`d the third-party `continual-learning-bench` repo\n2. ran `uv sync --all-extras` (executes build backends / install hooks\nof clbench's entire dependency tree)\n3. `uv pip install`ed the provider package\n4. …then finally ran `uv run clbench …`\n\nSo steps 1–3 executed untrusted install-time code **with all model\nsecrets present in the environment** — any malicious build backend could\nread them before the benchmark started.\n\n## Fix\n\nSplit the step in two and re-scope the LangSmith secret:\n\n- **📦 Set up clbench (no model keys)** — clone + checkout pinned SHA,\n`uv sync --all-extras`, provider-package install, `sync_to_clbench.sh`,\nbest-effort `clbench setup`. No provider keys and no `LANGSMITH_API_KEY`\nin its environment.\n- **🧠 Run …** — holds the provider keys, and now `LANGSMITH_API_KEY`\ntoo. Secrets exist **only** for the `uv run clbench …` execution, after\nall third-party code is already installed.\n- `LANGSMITH_API_KEY` moved off job-level `env:` onto the run step;\n`LANGSMITH_TRACING` (a GitHub expression, not the raw secret) stays at\njob level and the summary step still reads it.\n\nInput validations stay co-located with use: the `CLBENCH_REF` full-SHA\ncheck lives in the setup step (used by the clone); the\nper-task-parallelism / schedule / task-name regex guards stay in the run\nstep, right before those values are interpolated into commands and\npaths.\n\n## Notes\n- Shell logic is preserved verbatim — only relocated. `clbench-src` and\nits `.venv` persist across steps on the runner, so valid runs are\nunaffected.\n- Behavior delta: an invalid `concurrency`/`schedule`/`include_tasks`\ninput now fails after install rather than before (a rare error path; the\nregex guards remain where the values are used).\n- Verified: `actionlint` clean (exit 0); YAML parses.","tree":{"sha":"1621caf1875ad82c33f970bc659acdaa00c73445","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/1621caf1875ad82c33f970bc659acdaa00c73445"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/3e550ac0a33aadf886da2e2df0eadc743263b9b4","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPYXiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/oIQABRhVbmLOATnY1hnfHFfq4vk\n7YOFFGaqyJ+re06VtHDaWLpOv4l1eLeaYhjHwoOT8eD46X4q/WIoKeEsYWuyiQ00\nyblRo8D6EZCP1WR6IMpK6xCWVIwJaEFbXUk7Y5VbOMieNWTzUx3a0E35Gfjw8OF2\ntFz/ohJYHQN4PvjNAevgFFsgkbCll5LPkLuA/pT0Ih4kdOj9TrDYA6p4sRG5sOQq\nUGc+FhlxkZNoFvVNNTd1oISbh3OvEolu8PHVf/GrxosjamFJXzXPv5+nbusABihL\na0TqxSciZofLW7SCMF1Nme18+m9omeD+s/qrCaI5N6LhDnBe2e8aAnk/+/31dnxa\n/KxRFKkcZn8yvRP4f/J/azRAx7MJ17e4LCVMDtOmNByUE4mdQL3SHYUAGqgi6Tei\nnKXbjWxj612No8P2GIbwsjxhFPSjt9fNX8JBnCCmt7RgEaAnFr+WchMyHRySWmTE\nz4njuygb3hI4sziixqaUMBgqSErq9R63WIIYqGpe0x9LCO3foMdAah8tZ1sF74wM\nzGfg1N/o3M2Kz8oDorbeCLdDOWFYa0ynAAonCnpFZZ+v3GlNz5fsDaBVgEZTp/NG\n5fckc3AWa2qh3vrXJii8cifpMXFGVxFdFWcucj9v92gS4afbF2g/iQDKiDluGVC0\n+5I2pS9Z5sNPWwb7Pu40\n=jgnk\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 1621caf1875ad82c33f970bc659acdaa00c73445\nparent 24f1459b0937b300118f764299ba59e530f2b572\nauthor Nick Hollon <nick.hollon@langchain.dev> 1782416866 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782416866 -0400\n\nci(evals): scope clbench model secrets to the run step only (#4281)\n\n## Problem\n\nThe clbench workflow ran the whole benchmark in a **single** `run` step\nwhose `env:` injected every provider API key, with `LANGSMITH_API_KEY`\nset at the **job level**. That one step:\n\n1. `git clone`d the third-party `continual-learning-bench` repo\n2. ran `uv sync --all-extras` (executes build backends / install hooks\nof clbench's entire dependency tree)\n3. `uv pip install`ed the provider package\n4. …then finally ran `uv run clbench …`\n\nSo steps 1–3 executed untrusted install-time code **with all model\nsecrets present in the environment** — any malicious build backend could\nread them before the benchmark started.\n\n## Fix\n\nSplit the step in two and re-scope the LangSmith secret:\n\n- **📦 Set up clbench (no model keys)** — clone + checkout pinned SHA,\n`uv sync --all-extras`, provider-package install, `sync_to_clbench.sh`,\nbest-effort `clbench setup`. No provider keys and no `LANGSMITH_API_KEY`\nin its environment.\n- **🧠 Run …** — holds the provider keys, and now `LANGSMITH_API_KEY`\ntoo. Secrets exist **only** for the `uv run clbench …` execution, after\nall third-party code is already installed.\n- `LANGSMITH_API_KEY` moved off job-level `env:` onto the run step;\n`LANGSMITH_TRACING` (a GitHub expression, not the raw secret) stays at\njob level and the summary step still reads it.\n\nInput validations stay co-located with use: the `CLBENCH_REF` full-SHA\ncheck lives in the setup step (used by the clone); the\nper-task-parallelism / schedule / task-name regex guards stay in the run\nstep, right before those values are interpolated into commands and\npaths.\n\n## Notes\n- Shell logic is preserved verbatim — only relocated. `clbench-src` and\nits `.venv` persist across steps on the runner, so valid runs are\nunaffected.\n- Behavior delta: an invalid `concurrency`/`schedule`/`include_tasks`\ninput now fails after install rather than before (a rare error path; the\nregex guards remain where the values are used).\n- Verified: `actionlint` clean (exit 0); YAML parses.","verified_at":"2026-06-25T19:47:47Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3e550ac0a33aadf886da2e2df0eadc743263b9b4","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/3e550ac0a33aadf886da2e2df0eadc743263b9b4","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/3e550ac0a33aadf886da2e2df0eadc743263b9b4/comments","author":{"login":"nick-hollon-lc","id":274035459,"node_id":"U_kgDOEFVzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274035459?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc","html_url":"https://github.com/nick-hollon-lc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick-hollon-lc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"24f1459b0937b300118f764299ba59e530f2b572","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/24f1459b0937b300118f764299ba59e530f2b572","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/24f1459b0937b300118f764299ba59e530f2b572"}]},{"sha":"24f1459b0937b300118f764299ba59e530f2b572","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDI0ZjE0NTliMDkzN2IzMDAxMThmNzY0Mjk5YmE1OWU1MzBmMmI1NzI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-06-25T19:47:28Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-06-25T19:47:28Z"},"message":"chore(infra): update `CODEOWNERS` (#4282)\n\nUpdates CODEOWNERS to reflect the current ownership assignments\nrequested for repository infrastructure, SDK, evals, and ACP areas.\n\nThe ACP entry is removed because it no longer has owners after removing\n`@jacoblee93`.","tree":{"sha":"709faa13c5ad00357f1e194580ef11ffc9c87976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/709faa13c5ad00357f1e194580ef11ffc9c87976"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/24f1459b0937b300118f764299ba59e530f2b572","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPYXQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkFwQAJueqIGiJfBqGUrDlHxfThFo\nfG1OCW0O/Eap1gPwVNOC9jJon93BjXzemYMr8rxt6kB/isflkiIsoe+rmavmEyoM\n5u2CveRaOpYmJVvVLFVMZjTWDyFNvmOMW+uHy1NZ+lA5aafpJ0g4tKz6M2YpJSp3\nm1g4sCOegH7fUFi0A4+Whc8N5ywWg3EBwH+q+OloLUorETBH0ZErAm6G1OTzN6H6\nBtHVYDjOxQWXNKnPvYa0Ys4R/cXtmL5KDpQM+xicpXSOJbh7FqTAa999mabbSkO2\nhSrPtukiO8cxQclhKbDHxoU82KeBlvAeBRiBm79dzxa2oOS9hVqdOqJQpLnFMG8/\nPDQYcl0lAPfhK4dqT+U02zvedxIgvN42n26yNyatGJdboyxx+pXvgOgTXAoKTAhi\nMVl2xJgKCCZcQtRCCS+JzH3DP